Software Requirements
  Python- 3.8.0
  Libraries- 
    Mediapipe version: 0.10.10
    OpenCV
    NumPy
    Pickle 
    Scikit-learn 


Hardware Requirements
  Webcam



Dataset Requirements
  Images of Hand Gestures-
   * Stored in a structured directory (Data).
   * Multiple subfolders for different hand signs (e.g., A-Z, Backspace).
   * Consistent image resolution for better model accuracy.



Project Structure
 * Data Collection: collectData.py
 * Creation of Dataset: createDataSet.py
 * Model Training: trainModel.py
 * Evaluation: runModel.py
